---
// Exact 1:1 Flutter UI replication for Brew Doctor & Kompas SCA (brew_doctor_compass_screen.dart)
import Icon from '../ui/Icon.astro';
---

<div class="brew-doctor-mockup flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between bg-[#F9F6F0] text-[#332B25] select-none text-xs h-full overflow-hidden">
  
  <div class="p-2.5 space-y-2 overflow-y-auto no-scrollbar flex-1">
    
    <!-- Top AppBar -->
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-1 border-b border-[#E8DFD8]">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 font-extrabold text-[11.5px] text-[#332B25]">
        <Icon name="stethoscope" size={13} color="#6B4423" />
        <span>Brew Doctor & Kompas SCA</span>
      </div>
      <span class="doc-ey-tds px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-[#E8F5E9] text-[#2E7D32] text-[7.5px] font-extrabold rounded-md border border-[#C8E6C9]">
        EY 20.1% • TDS 1.38%
      </span>
    </div>

    <!-- 1. 2D SCA Extraction vs Strength Compass (Exact match with _ScaCompassPainter) -->
    <div class="bg-white p-2 rounded-xl border border-[#E7DDD3] shadow-2xs space-y-1">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[8.5px] font-extrabold text-[#332B25]">
        <span>Kompas Sensorik & Ekstraksi SCA</span>
        <span class="text-[7.5px] text-[#8F857D] font-semibold">X: Yield • Y: TDS</span>
      </div>

      <!-- 2D Grid Plot with Center Golden Cup Zone & Animated Dot -->
      <div class="relative w-full h-20 rounded-lg bg-[#FAF6F1] border border-[#E7DDD3] overflow-hidden">
        <!-- Quadrant Labels -->
        <span class="absolute top-1 left-1.5 text-[6.5px] font-bold text-[#8F857D]/80">PEKAT • ASAM</span>
        <span class="absolute top-1 right-1.5 text-[6.5px] font-bold text-[#8F857D]/80">PEKAT • PAHIT</span>
        <span class="absolute bottom-1 left-1.5 text-[6.5px] font-bold text-[#8F857D]/80">ENCER • ASAM</span>
        <span class="absolute bottom-1 right-1.5 text-[6.5px] font-bold text-[#8F857D]/80">ENCER • PAHIT</span>

        <!-- Crosshair Axes -->
        <div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-1/2 h-[1px] bg-[#D8CBBF]/70"></div>
        <div class="absolute inset-y-0 left-1/2 w-[1px] bg-[#D8CBBF]/70"></div>

        <!-- Golden Cup Ideal Sweet Spot Zone (18-22% EY, 1.15-1.45% TDS) -->
        <div class="absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-16 h-9 rounded-md bg-emerald-500/15 border border-emerald-600/50 flex items-center justify-center">
          <span class="text-[6.5px] font-extrabold text-emerald-800 tracking-tight">GOLDEN CUP</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Live Brew Coordinate Dot -->
        <div
          class="doc-compass-dot absolute w-3 h-3 -ml-1.5 -mt-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#2E7D32] border-2 border-white shadow-md transition-all duration-300"
          style="left: 50%; top: 50%;"
        ></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 2. Sensory Sliders (Dynamically updated via simulation!) -->
    <div class="bg-white p-2 rounded-xl border border-[#E8DFD8] shadow-2xs space-y-1.5">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-2.5 gap-y-1.5">
        <!-- Sweetness -->
        <div>
          <div class="flex justify-between text-[8px] font-bold">
            <span class="text-[#6F655D]">Sweetness</span>
            <span class="doc-val-sweet text-[#ECA400]">4.5 / 5.0</span>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full bg-[#E8DFD8] h-1.5 rounded-full overflow-hidden mt-0.5">
            <div class="doc-bar-sweet bg-[#ECA400] h-full w-[85%] rounded-full transition-all duration-300"></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Acidity -->
        <div>
          <div class="flex justify-between text-[8px] font-bold">
            <span class="text-[#6F655D]">Acidity</span>
            <span class="doc-val-acid text-[#6B4423]">3.5 / 5.0</span>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full bg-[#E8DFD8] h-1.5 rounded-full overflow-hidden mt-0.5">
            <div class="doc-bar-acid bg-[#6B4423] h-full w-[70%] rounded-full transition-all duration-300"></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Bitterness -->
        <div>
          <div class="flex justify-between text-[8px] font-bold">
            <span class="text-[#6F655D]">Bitterness</span>
            <span class="doc-val-bitter text-[#6F655D]">1.8 / 5.0</span>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full bg-[#E8DFD8] h-1.5 rounded-full overflow-hidden mt-0.5">
            <div class="doc-bar-bitter bg-[#8F857D] h-full w-[36%] rounded-full transition-all duration-300"></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Body -->
        <div>
          <div class="flex justify-between text-[8px] font-bold">
            <span class="text-[#6F655D]">Body</span>
            <span class="doc-val-body text-[#6B4423]">4.0 / 5.0</span>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full bg-[#E8DFD8] h-1.5 rounded-full overflow-hidden mt-0.5">
            <div class="doc-bar-body bg-[#6B4423] h-full w-[80%] rounded-full transition-all duration-300"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 3. Diagnosis Banner (Dynamically syncs!) -->
    <div class="doc-diag-box p-2 rounded-xl bg-[#E8F5E9] border border-emerald-300 text-emerald-950 shadow-2xs transition-colors duration-300">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 font-bold text-[10px] text-emerald-800 doc-diag-title">
        <Icon name="target" size={12} color="currentColor" />
        <span>Sweet Spot! Ekstraksi Seimbang</span>
      </div>
      <p class="doc-diag-desc text-[8px] text-emerald-900 mt-0.5 leading-snug">
        Keseimbangan rasa manis dan asam buah sangat harmonis. Aftertaste bersih dan aroma seduhan terekstraksi maksimal.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 4. Doctor Prescription Card (Matches _rxChip & Calibrated Timer Card) -->
    <div class="p-2 rounded-xl bg-[#FFF8EE] border border-[#ECA400]/50 shadow-2xs">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-[9px] font-extrabold text-[#6B4423]">
        <Icon name="sparkles" size={10} color="#6B4423" />
        <span>Resep Kalibrasi Brew Doctor:</span>
      </div>
      <p class="doc-rx-text text-[8px] text-[#4E342E] mt-0.5 leading-snug">
        Pertahankan settingan 22 klik Comandante C40 dan suhu 92°C untuk biji sangrai ini. Simpan ke Jurnal Brew untuk referensi seduh esok hari.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- Bottom Action Button (Matches 'Buka Brew Timer dengan Parameter Baru') -->
  <div class="p-2 bg-white border-t border-[#E8DFD8] shrink-0">
    <button class="w-full py-1.5 bg-[#6B4423] text-white rounded-xl text-center font-extrabold text-[9px] shadow-xs flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 hover:bg-[#563519] transition-colors cursor-pointer">
      <Icon name="timer" size={11} color="#FFFFFF" />
      <span>Buka Brew Timer Parameter Baru</span>
    </button>
  </div>

</div>
